      <h3 id="_specgrpcservertlsconfig" class="group scroll-mt-20">.spec.grpcServerTlsConfig<a href="#_specgrpcservertlsconfig" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground">
      <p>grpcServerTlsConfig defines the gRPC server from which Thanos Querier reads recorded rule data.</p>
      <p>Note: Currently only the <code>minVersion</code>, <code>caFile</code>, <code>certFile</code>, and <code>keyFile</code> fields are supported.</p>
      </dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Type</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><CodeBlock code={"`object`"} lang="plaintext" /></dd>
      </dl>
