      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>capacity</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>integer</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>capacity defines the number of samples to buffer per shard before we start dropping them.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
