      <h3 id="_specvolumescsi" class="group scroll-mt-20">.spec.volumes[].csi<a href="#_specvolumescsi" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>csi (Container Storage Interface) represents ephemeral storage that is handled by certain external CSI drivers.</p></dd>
