      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>APIGroup is the group for the resource being referenced. If APIGroup is not specified, the specified Kind must be in the core API group. For any other third-party types, APIGroup is required.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
