      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground">
      <p>ClusterTrustBundle allows a pod to access the <code>.spec.trustBundle</code> field of ClusterTrustBundle objects in an auto-updating file.</p>
      <p>Alpha, gated by the ClusterTrustBundleProjection feature gate.</p>
      <p>ClusterTrustBundle objects can either be selected by name, or by the combination of signer name and a label selector.</p>
      <p>Kubelet performs aggressive normalization of the PEM contents written into the pod filesystem.  Esoteric PEM features such as inter-block comments and block headers are stripped.  Certificates are deduplicated. The ordering of certificates within the file is arbitrary, and Kubelet may change the order over time.</p>
