      <h3 id="_specvolumessecret" class="group scroll-mt-20">.spec.volumes[].secret<a href="#_specvolumessecret" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>secret represents a secret that should populate this volume. More info: https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/storage/volumes#secret</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Type</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><CodeBlock code={"`object`"} lang="plaintext" /></dd>
